{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-nesba-3","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"nesba-3-arada-properties-muwaileh-commercial","about":"Nesba 3 - a 9-storey residential complex in Aljada district. Designed by the Arada Properties it offers modern and stylish apartments with one, two, and three bedrooms.One of the key advantages of Aljada is its direct access to the main sports complex. This complex features a full-size football pitch, 5-a-side pitches, and extensive facilities for padel tennis, basketball, volleyball, and badminton. The sports complex is set in a beautiful landscaped green park, providing the perfect place for an active lifestyle.Another advantage is the proximity to East Boulevard, a popular shopping and dining destination known for its tree-lined streets. As a resident of Aljada, you will have exclusive access to the gym and swimming pool, making it easy to maintain your fitness routine.The SABIS International School is just a 2-minute walk away, while the Madar family entertainment complex and Naseej cultural district are both within a 5-minute walk. If you prefer shopping and business, Arada CBD, Aljada's business park, is just a 10-minute walk away.Nesba 3 is not just a residential complex it is a landmark that will redefine Sharjah living. As the hub of new Sharjah, Aljada offers a vibrant and unique urban environment where everything is within easy reach. Whether you are looking for a place to live, work, entertain, recreate, shop, or experience culture, Aljada has it all.","price":918000,"title":"Nesba 3","bitrix":{"id":916,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":"Nesba 3","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Nesba 3","property_type":"Villas","developer_name":"Arada Developments","project_location":"Muwaileh Commercial"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/2859/images/2024/08/22/340x252/rhaNksiTQ4sjQrR4RqAa7LZW78eyfBzqWYm